# Every non-comment rule in .gitignore is repeated here VERBATIM, in order, and
# tests/dockerignore_superset_test.sh fails the build if one goes missing.
#
# This is not tidiness.  .gitignore is where the secrets live: *.key, .env and
# data/authorized_keys are kept out of the repo precisely because they are
# secret -- and the runtime stage of the Dockerfile does `COPY . /opt/nvkvm`
# into an image published under the ghcr name.  Anything Git hides and Docker
# does not therefore gets baked into a public image layer, where `docker
# history` reads it back out.  Order matters: the `!` negations below only work
# if they still follow the rule they re-include, exactly as in .gitignore.
#
# ── mirrored from .gitignore ────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.o
*.ko
*.mod
*.mod.c
*.mod.o
!go.mod
!go.sum
*.symvers
*.order
.tmp_versions/
Module.symvers
modules.builtin
modules.order
*.so
src/stub/nvkvm_stub
src/stub/nvkvm_stub_bin.h
.vscode/
.idea/
*.key
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
tests/unit/test_objects
tests/unit/test_handle
tests/unit/test_isolate
tests/unit/test_tables
tests/unit/test_open_scm
tests/unit/test_ctrl_gate
tests/unit/mock_stub
tests/unit/test_nvkms_allowlist
tests/unit/test_stub_ptr_sanitize
tests/unit/test_kvm_slot
tests/unit/test_r1_type_dev
tests/unit/test_transport_ready
tests/unit/stub_sanitize.inc
tests/unit/kvm_slot_pool.inc
tests/unit/test_stub_window
tests/unit/stub_window.inc
tests/unit/win_alloc.inc
tests/unit/test_drm_devinfo
tests/unit/drm_param_structs.inc
tests/unit/r1_type_dev.inc
tests/unit/r1_stub_type_dev.inc
sweep-runs/
tests/unit/transport_ready.inc
data/authorized_keys
data/root_authorized_keys
tests/unit/test_*
!tests/unit/test_*.c
!tests/unit/test_*.py
!tests/unit/test_*.sh
src/guest/.*.cmd
src/guest/*.o
src/guest/*.ko
src/guest/*.mod*
src/guest/Module.symvers
src/guest/modules.order

# ── Docker-only exclusions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repository metadata, large media and disk images: never a build input, and
# each one invalidates the build cache for free.
.git
docs/img/*.gif
*.qcow2
*.img
*.iso
